{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question","id":1348364,"title":"\"Americanism\" Dreamspeaker question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-13T17:16:59-08:00","id":1348364,"title":"\"Americanism\" Dreamspeaker question","content":"I had a quirky idea:<br /> <br /> Theoretically, could there be a Dreamspeaker devoted to the traditional spirits of America, such as justice and law, along with their various representations (including the Founding Fathers, continental and union civil war generals, etc)? Most importantly, how would something like that work? I imagine there could be a variety of scenarios in which that Dreamspeaker's loyalty to the spirits is caused into question, since the Technocracy has such a hold over the current American government (and a &quot;patriot&quot; Dreamspeaker would most likely support their gov)<br /> <br /> What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12664-kingjohn","name":"KingJohn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T17:53:21-08:00","id":1348373,"title":"","content":"I suspect most native American Dreamspeakers would be shocked, disgusted, and appalled. These are concepts of the Order of Reason / Technocracy. The oppressors. The genocidal butchers. <i>But</i>, knowing what I do about anthropology, there might be one or two with Stockholm syndrome or some such. In history, there were a few Nazi sympathizers that were Jewish. There were African Americans that fought for the Confederacy. In an AD&amp;D game I ran long ago, I had a player character that was half-troll. There was ethnic conflict with the elves, and the player took the elf side because the other players were humans or elves and he wanted to fit in. That's just what people do in real life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25651-marko-markoko","name":"Marko Markoko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25651_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T18:19:22-08:00","id":1348378,"title":"","content":"I'm imagining that this character would be a white American history teacher or something like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12664-kingjohn","name":"KingJohn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T20:29:57-08:00","id":1348400,"title":"","content":"Some W:tApoc spirits are associated with various bits of Americana, and they're still Gaian spirits - I think you can have a pack dedicated to The American Dream, for instance.<br /> <br /> Importantly, the umbral spirits of America-the-concept have no obligation to be sympathetic with the government or policies of America-the-real-place or the Technocracy's vision for America. Even the deified Founding Fathers (as ancestor spirits) aren't really the ghosts of the flawed mortals they are based on - the Spirit of Jefferson is likely a much worthier man than Jefferson himself, an idealized remembrance. Given that Dreamspeaker themes expect the shaman to be in a fraught, liminal place, I'd expect (thematically) a Dreamspeaker whose patron is The American Dream or Lady Liberty to be an outsider and idealist, a rather different sort of &quot;patriot&quot; than the people who brand themselves patriots.<br /> <br /> They probably don't have a place in the major Dreamspeaker blocs - they're not going to make any friends with the Red Spear or Sacred Flame, who recall all too intimately the ways in which the Dream wasn't there for them and their ancestors and won't appreciate the whitewashing the Spirit-Founders would have received.<br /> <br /> (You could also do an Edward Abbey style Solitaire whose &quot;America&quot; is the grandeur of the continent's vast wilderness.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i> I attack people with giant insects both </i>on <i>and </i>off <i>the court.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1653-five-eyes","name":"Five Eyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"395"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-14T01:38:54-08:00","id":1348439,"title":"","content":"Real world Native American religious thought has included the founding fathers. And remember, Washington, Franklin, Paine, Jefferson, and Madison, all wanted to bring the Native Americans into the USA as equals. They were men of the Enlightenment. It's the Romantics, men like Henry Clay, Andrew Jackson, and Jefferson Davis, who wanted to exclude the Native Americans. Both Washington and Franklin stated that the future America would be a cultural blend of Native American and European.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T04:57:15-08:00","id":1348644,"title":"","content":"This dreamapeaker would bem quite, quiiiiiiite idealistic, way more than patriot. I dont want to criticize USA but its was never that much about freedom, justice or law, as much as any country is not.<br /> Patriotism is something that never got much sense to a mage, since its mostly propaganda of the New Wolrd Order on society with the intent of even more social control.<br /> <br /> It feels strange that a mage with Spirit, being able to speak and cross to multiple realities would care about the concept of a country developed by the Union, on a very limited and hypocritical reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24274-menos125","name":"menos125","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T05:49:36-08:00","id":1348649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>menos125</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1348644#post1348644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This dreamapeaker would bem quite, quiiiiiiite idealistic, way more than patriot. I dont want to criticize USA but its was never that much about freedom, justice or law, as much as any country is not.<br /> Patriotism is something that never got much sense to a mage, since its mostly propaganda of the New Wolrd Order on society with the intent of even more social control.<br /> <br /> It feels strange that a mage with Spirit, being able to speak and cross to multiple realities would care about the concept of a country developed by the Union, on a very limited and hypocritical reality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hypocracy isn't the right word. Given the present day USA is constantly attacked as hypocrital by those who feel the USA owes them obedience. Right-wingers attack us too you know. We are flawed but democracy and freedom, even if we haven't been consistent with either ideal, are still noble and radical ideals. Many powerful people still fear and hate these ideals. They've always needed to eliminate America's good name as a way of saying &quot;Look democracy can't work &quot; Yes many times our mistakes and moral flaws have made their job easier, but we have done good and worthy things. The USA is a democracy, flawed, yes, but a democracy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 05-25-2020, 07:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T06:57:44-08:00","id":1348661,"title":"","content":"As an outsider, American patriotism seems like a messy thing. You've got a right-right wing party, then you've got a right wing party promoting 'left' wing values. You've got a mythical history. A mythical way of looking at yourselves and your political system and your patriotism (whatever that patriotism might be) You've got this Mythical &quot;left' (neoliberal) and bizzare right.<br /> <br /> 'merica is a land of spirit, powerful spirits. <br /> If I were you, I'd take this idea and run with it. Be a capitalist to the extreme. You are Neoliberalism incarnate. You're a propaganda machine with spirit and mind. Your goal is to make billions. Screw the Dreamspeakers working with nature spirits, you're out there to capture the american dream!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T10:33:15-08:00","id":1348687,"title":"","content":"What tradition would this character best fit into, then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12664-kingjohn","name":"KingJohn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T11:29:04-08:00","id":1348696,"title":"","content":"This seems like someone who's Paradigm was built as a Thought experiment. Like it uses a very complicated understanding of the Umbra and a very blaise view of symbolism. So it comes off as very Chaos Magicy. I can't see someone naturally coming to this but rather coming to this via the method you came to this and that's pretty much as I said Chaos Magic. They are creating mental patterns that they may infact know are false for purposes of focusing their will and symbolism.<br /> <br /> So I'd argue this is probably something in the Hollow One bandwagon or Discordian Hermetics. I also imagine the person would be more than willing to swap out their symbolism and themes when trying different things i honestly can't imagine someone using this as their &quot;true&quot; practice but rather a practice they use for particular things.<br /> <br /> I Mean people are fundimentally part of their culture. Can you seriously imagine someone believing in an Animistic world but built around Americana? I mean the WOD isn't that alien a place the practices and paradigms are generally taken from real world cultural practices and occult traditions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T12:57:12-08:00","id":1348712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1348696#post1348696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This seems like someone who's Paradigm was built as a Thought experiment. Like it uses a very complicated understanding of the Umbra and a very blaise view of symbolism. So it comes off as very Chaos Magicy. I can't see someone naturally coming to this but rather coming to this via the method you came to this and that's pretty much as I said Chaos Magic. They are creating mental patterns that they may infact know are false for purposes of focusing their will and symbolism.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't say Chaos Magick presupposes the mental patterns are false. Rather, they are artificial. <i>Constructed</i>. They exist, but only because people made them and then empowered them through mental focus.<br /> <br /> A Dreamspeaker who accepts &quot;the American Spirit&quot; in this way understands that America is an idea founded centuries ago and then developed over time. But it's such a widespread idea, it has plenty of life unto itself. The American thought form, or Egregore, has power because people give it power. This, in turn, can provide the Mage with power if they know how to interface with it. They may also be highly mindful of how different views of America affect how its thought form/essential spirit manifests.<br /> <br /> The brighter parts of America as an idealized construct are held back or marred by all the negative aspects of the nation seeping into the Egregore. The Mage may be inclined towards political activism, if only to make the reality of America more in line with its ideal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T18:19:26-08:00","id":1348764,"title":"","content":"As I've noted before, this is the sort of &quot;out in left field&quot; spiritualism and shamanism that the Ghost Wheel Society has always been devoted to exploring, especially the sort of things that much more traditionalist Dreamspeakers (the Keepers of the Sacred Fire come to mind) would turn their nose up at for one reason or another. Also, the Baruti, being storytellers and lore keepers by trade, do focus a lot on collecting the histories of various people's, both mainstream and forgotten. This sort of thing gives a much more well rounded world view and understanding of the stories involved. Ultimately, the Manichaeistic version presented by Howard Zinn and his ilk is every bit as shallow and useless as the Jingoist triumphism that grew out of turn of the century progressive nationalism. <br /> <br /> Personally, I find the idea of a Dreamspeaker historian who has conversations with ghosts like a George Washington who is regretful over what happened with the Iroquois during the Revolution or a Davey Crocket still holding a grudge against Andrew Jackson over removing the Southeastern tribes to be rather fascinating from a story potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T14:31:14-08:00","id":1349689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1348661#post1348661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As an outsider, American patriotism seems like a messy thing. You've got a right-right wing party, then you've got a right wing party promoting 'left' wing values. You've got a mythical history. A mythical way of looking at yourselves and your political system and your patriotism (whatever that patriotism might be) You've got this Mythical &amp;quot;left' (neoliberal) and bizzare right.<br /> <br /> 'merica is a land of spirit, powerful spirits. <br /> If I were you, I'd take this idea and run with it. Be a capitalist to the extreme. You are Neoliberalism incarnate. You're a propaganda machine with spirit and mind. Your goal is to make billions. Screw the Dreamspeakers working with nature spirits, you're out there to capture the american dream!</div> </div> </div> </div>Excuse me Neo-Liberalism is an Anglo-Austrian idea. Paine's &quot;Rights of Man&quot; is the first serious attempt to promote a Welfare State and end poverty. Jefferson was nearly as skeptical about private property as Marx. Teddy Roosevelt proposed national Health Care before Llyod George. American does not equal Neo-Liberal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T15:18:20-08:00","id":1349701,"title":"","content":"Bah, those're the exceptions rather than the rule. If Teddies were elected more often America would look like a left leaning extension of europe with more guns. Fact is; after Teddy, there came Wilson. Whatever the truth was, it doesn't matter now. The American ideal is basically libertarianism or christian conservatism. Neo-liberalism might not be americas original idea, but it's the one that stuck. I don't think this is the place to talk politics, but you've gotta remember that Spirits in the umbra don't follow the truth, they follow the idea, the concept, that most people have. Maybe you're right and early Americans had some genuine leftist thoughts, but given decades of 'Health care is un-american communism' and underfunded public schools, I don't think it matters. But the spirits of capital, free market and exceptionalism are well fed and worthy summons that'd be a huge boon in a modernised Dream Speaker arsenal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-02T13:45:36-08:00","id":1352211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1348649#post1348649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hypocracy isn't the right word. Given the present day USA is constantly attacked as hypocrital by those who feel the USA owes them obedience. Right-wingers attack us to you know. We are flawed but democracy and freedom, even if we haven't been consistent with either ideal, are still noble and radical ideals. Many powerful people still fear and hate these ideals. They've always needed to eliminate America's good name as a way of saying &quot;Look democracy can't work &quot; Yes many times our mistakes and moral flaws have made their job easier, but we have done good and worthy things. The USA is a democracy, flawed, yes, but a democracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>This isn\u2019t a attack against you. But fuck this Country, it was founded by Genocidal, Racist pieces of shit, and continued to be for all its history up to now. See many Americans hypocritical attitude to Immigrants.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=cCoQV22-a8k\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=cCoQV22-a8k\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=cCoQV22-a8k\" target=\"_blank\"> https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=cCoQV22-a8k </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 12-02-2019, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T18:53:41-08:00","id":1352500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1352211#post1352211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This isn\u2019t a attack against you. But fuck this Country, it was founded by Genocidal, Racist pieces of shit, and continued to be for all its history up to now. See many Americans hypocritical attitude to Immigrants.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=cCoQV22-a8k\" target=\"_blank\">https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=cCoQV22-a8k</a></div> </div> </div> </div>It isn't hypocritical to ask that our laws be obeyed. I kinda find this whole thread pretty damn insulting as a patriotic black American who understands what the word 'patriot' actually means rather than viewing it through a lens of new age woke cynicism. Thanks for insulting everyone who has and will lay down their lives to make the ideal a reality, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T21:05:05-08:00","id":1352510,"title":"","content":"Though I hate that this is turning political, I kind of agree with Konradleijon.I love this country but I hate what it has become. I used to be super patriotic. but we started putting children in concentration camps. That just killed it for me. It is not just about the orange guy in office. People gladly played along with it. The American dream is just about dead. And yeah, it is hypocritical to obey our laws when they are wrong. It is the duty of every honorable patriot to disobey unjust laws. And to help others break unjust laws. In addition, this is not off topic at all. About a third of the text of M20 is some righteous SJW soapboxing. Written by a true Gen-Xr. Indeed, that is a major subtext found in all the oWoD games. The ideal is not a reality at all. You are deluded to think so. But I do not blame you. I used to buy into the propaganda myself. I wish there was a way to save America, but I am not hopeful. This Union is going to break apart in a few years or less if radical change is not made.<br /> <br /> I kinda thing a moderator should lock this thread before shit gets nasty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25651,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25651-marko-markoko","user":"Marko Markoko","date":". 12-04-2019, 12:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25651-marko-markoko","name":"Marko Markoko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25651_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T23:25:59-08:00","id":1352534,"title":"","content":"If you won't enforce the law now then you won't enforce any law ever. Change and improvement is meaningless once you set a precedent that everything a small group of people disagrees with just be ignored. When you break the law you should be treated accordingly - as a criminal. Now we can talk about how criminals are treated in this country and I'll agree we need to revamp our criminal justice system. But saying that foreign entities are allowed to cross our borders as they please is not acceptable.<br /> <br /> And yeah I do agree that Mage20 is so cringily SJW it made me put the book down a few times. I remember the Akashic Brotherhood entry was a real eyeroller.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T00:53:35-08:00","id":1352552,"title":"","content":"The founding fathers were all lawbreakers. American culture has ever been about breaking the law. The precedent you speak of has been set hundreds of years ago and has been ever repeating. The only laws I consider unbreakable are contained in the volume of sacred law (if you don't know i am not allowed to tell you).<br /> I find M20's SJW approach fun and refreshing. It appeals to my Chaotic Good nature.<br /> Law does not equal Morality. Harriet Tubman was a criminal, broke many laws working with the Underground Railroad. Moral Law takes precedence over the laws of governments. In Nazi Germany, turning over Jews was the law, sheltering was a crime. I choose the crime. I bring that up because that is what is happening in America right now. We are teetering on the edge of the pit of fascism, and if we fall in there is no coming back. If you don't understand, I can't help you. All I can suggest is that you do some soul searching. I am not saying you are immoral. I am saying you are misguided and confused. The very way you phrase things demonstrated that you have drunk the kool aid.<br /> There is no point in continuing this conversation. There is no point in posting a reply to me, but go ahead if you want. There is no point in me replying to it if you do. Go aheadand have the last word. All I can do is pray that one day you will understand how very wrong you are.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25651-marko-markoko","name":"Marko Markoko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25651_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T01:08:14-08:00","id":1352557,"title":"","content":"This thread will not end well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T03:28:01-08:00","id":1352566,"title":"","content":"Going back to the initial question I would say: yes. In Werewolf there are many urban spirits, such as the City Fathers, the American Dream an spirits of money and wealth, that could be suitable for a such character. However, an &quot;american patriot&quot; Dreamspeaker could have problems with other factions of the Tradition.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2250-magus","name":"Magus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T10:31:42-08:00","id":1352639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1352566#post1352566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Going back to the initial question I would say: yes. In Werewolf there are many urban spirits, such as the City Fathers, the American Dream an spirits of money and wealth, that could be suitable for a such character. However, an &quot;american patriot&quot; Dreamspeaker could have problems with other factions of the Tradition.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I agree with this. I could easily see them being kicked out and forced to join the OoH as an Ex Miscellenea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T02:26:59-08:00","id":1352979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1352639#post1352639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I agree with this. I could easily see them being kicked out and forced to join the OoH as an Ex Miscellenea.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know if the Dreamspeakers would actually kick such a character out. The Tradition is organized such that few have the authority to just banish a character for such subjective reasons. Banishing someone for being a Barrabus or Infernalist, yes, but not because they hang out with spirits associated with America. You don't get a conclave of Dreamspeakers together for anything less than Serious Business. Much less would such a banishment be enforceable.<br /> <br /> Now, not liking such a character would be pretty understandable and common. Plenty of spirit talkers would elect to have nothing to do with them. Tradition politics is the same as regular politics, and social bonds are among the strongest the Dreamspeakers have. So the character wouldn't exactly be in a great position. But if even a small portion of the Tradition liked the character - or even just tolerated them - that would be enough for them to function as a &quot;True Dreamspeaker&quot; (if such a phrase means anything at all).<br /> <br /> The REAL defining factor is whether the <i>SPIRITS</i> were willing to the deal with the character. If the character had a decent - or at least neutral - standing in the spirit world, there's not a lot other Dreamspeakers can do. Especially if the character had some powerful Umbrood as allies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-15T05:49:01-08:00","id":1354985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quo