cal,Racist, Genocidal, pieces of shit, that people worship as the \u201cFounding fathers\u201d.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T16:00:35-07:00","id":1391318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1348364-americanism-dreamspeaker-question?p=1354985#post1354985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Stop comparing the Bravery of abolitionists to those Hypocritical,Racist, Genocidal, pieces of shit, that people worship as the \u201cFounding fathers\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Benjamin Franklin founded the first antislavery society in America. Tom Paine and Franklin were both antislavery and antiracist and wanted that written into the constitution. Hamilton, for all his faults was also passionately antislavery. Jefferson braved physical attack to push antislavery and antiracist laws in the Virginia legislature, he failed, but he suffered wounds in the attempt. Both Washington, Jefferson, Madison, Morris, Hamilton, Paine, Samuel and John Adams, and Franklin, especially Franklin, all wanted the Native Americans brought in as States of the Union.<br /> <br /> Given it was only competition with 